}

### 7. 登录 B
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "username": "{{userB}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 7.1 登录 B 后刷新 CSRF
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/csrf

> {%
  var setCookie = response.headers.valueOf("Set-Cookie");
  var match = setCookie ? setCookie.match(/XSRF-TOKEN=([^;]+)/) : null;
