### 8. B 回答
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/questions/{{questionId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "body": "看叔叔节点颜色和插入位置：叔叔红则变色上移，叔叔黑则按 LL/LR/RR/RL 旋转。"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("answerId", response.body.id);
%}

### 9. B 退出
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### 10. 重新获取 CSRF
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/csrf

> {%
  var setCookie = response.headers.valueOf("Set-Cookie");
  var match = setCookie ? setCookie.match(/XSRF-TOKEN=([^;]+)/) : null;
  client.global.set("csrf", match ? match[1] : response.body.token);
%}

