### 12. A 给 B 的回答投票
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "targetType": "ANSWER",
  "targetId": {{answerId}},
  "value": 1
}

### 13. A 采纳 B 的回答
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/questions/{{questionId}}/accepted-answer
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "answerId": {{answerId}}
}

### 14. 查询详情，验证已采纳
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/questions/{{questionId}}
